  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Australia&apos;s core funding contribution to the Pandemic Fund. The Pandemic Fund is a multi-donor Financial Intermediary Fund hosted by the World Bank. It aims to provide a sustainable and dedicated resource stream for pandemic preparedness, prevention and response, catalyse and incentivise domestic financing and investments, and enhance coordination among partners.</narrative>
